  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a medium bowl, whisk together Thai red curry paste, honey, soy sauce, and kissed sesame oil.",
    "3. Add apricots to the bowl and toss to coat with curry paste mixture.",
    "4. Thread apricots and any additional ingredients (such as crunchy peanut butter) onto skewers.",
    "5. Grill skewers for 2-3 minutes per side, or until apricots are tender.",
    "6. Serve warm and enjoy!"
